      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "© 2016 The Author(s).",
        "AbstractText": "A 19-year-old golfer presented to the sports clinic with a 2-week history of dominant-hand pain after several months of daily golf. He had a metacarpal stress fracture. This case discusses the athlete's return-to-play timeline as well as reviews the current limited literature guiding return to play in grip athletes."
      },
